  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.104 “Written” means, unless otherwise specified, printed by hand or provided by any other method of representing words and letters, including by electronic means.\n\nSource. #10238, eff 3-18-13); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.70); renumbered by #13667 (formerly Per 102.77); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.94), eff 12-1-25",
